1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,079
April was the month the receipts stacked vertically.

2
00:00:03,079 --> 00:00:08,492
First, the Korea Grand Music Awards, where fans don't nominate — they vote.

3
00:00:08,492 --> 00:00:17,293
Artist of April, solo female category: thirty-three thousand three hundred and eighty votes, eighty-five point eight one percent of the total.

4
00:00:17,293 --> 00:00:27,564
Then, on the seventeenth, the trade press confirmed it: SHEESH had crossed four hundred million views, faster than any girl-group debut video ever recorded.

